//! AArch64 application-profile architecture revisions.

/// Armv8.1-A AArch64 revision selector. TIR uses the declared prerequisites to group available
/// instructions; this marker does not imply complete revision support.
///
/// See [Arm Architecture Reference Manual, architecture extensions](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest/).
isa ARMv8_1A64 requires ARMv8A64 {}
/// Armv8.2-A AArch64 revision selector. TIR uses the declared prerequisites to group available
/// instructions; this marker does not imply complete revision support.
///
/// See [Arm Architecture Reference Manual, architecture extensions](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest/).
isa ARMv8_2A64 requires ARMv8_1A64 {}
/// Armv8.3-A AArch64 revision selector. TIR uses the declared prerequisites to group available
/// instructions; this marker does not imply complete revision support.
///
/// See [Arm Architecture Reference Manual, architecture extensions](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest/).
isa ARMv8_3A64 requires ARMv8_2A64 {}
/// Armv8.4-A AArch64 revision selector. TIR uses the declared prerequisites to group available
/// instructions; this marker does not imply complete revision support.
///
/// See [Arm Architecture Reference Manual, architecture extensions](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest/).
isa ARMv8_4A64 requires ARMv8_3A64 {}
/// Armv8.5-A AArch64 revision selector. TIR uses the declared prerequisites to group available
/// instructions; this marker does not imply complete revision support.
///
/// See [Arm Architecture Reference Manual, architecture extensions](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest/).
isa ARMv8_5A64 requires ARMv8_4A64 {}
/// Armv8.6-A AArch64 revision selector. TIR uses the declared prerequisites to group available
/// instructions; this marker does not imply complete revision support.
///
/// See [Arm Architecture Reference Manual, architecture extensions](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest/).
isa ARMv8_6A64 requires ARMv8_5A64 {}
/// Armv8.7-A AArch64 revision selector. TIR uses the declared prerequisites to group available
/// instructions; this marker does not imply complete revision support.
///
/// See [Arm Architecture Reference Manual, architecture extensions](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest/).
isa ARMv8_7A64 requires ARMv8_6A64 {}
/// Armv8.8-A AArch64 revision selector. TIR uses the declared prerequisites to group available
/// instructions; this marker does not imply complete revision support.
///
/// See [Arm Architecture Reference Manual, architecture extensions](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest/).
isa ARMv8_8A64 requires ARMv8_7A64 {}
/// Armv8.9-A AArch64 revision selector. TIR uses the declared prerequisites to group available
/// instructions; this marker does not imply complete revision support.
///
/// See [Arm Architecture Reference Manual, architecture extensions](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest/).
isa ARMv8_9A64 requires ARMv8_8A64 {}

/// Armv9-A AArch64 revision selector. TIR uses the declared prerequisites to group available
/// instructions; this marker does not imply complete revision support.
///
/// See [Arm Architecture Reference Manual, architecture extensions](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest/).
isa ARMv9A64 requires ARMv8_5A64 {}
/// Armv9.1-A AArch64 revision selector. TIR uses the declared prerequisites to group available
/// instructions; this marker does not imply complete revision support.
///
/// See [Arm Architecture Reference Manual, architecture extensions](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest/).
isa ARMv9_1A64 requires [ARMv9A64, ARMv8_6A64] {}
/// Armv9.2-A AArch64 revision selector. TIR uses the declared prerequisites to group available
/// instructions; this marker does not imply complete revision support.
///
/// See [Arm Architecture Reference Manual, architecture extensions](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest/).
isa ARMv9_2A64 requires [ARMv9_1A64, ARMv8_7A64] {}
/// Armv9.3-A AArch64 revision selector. TIR uses the declared prerequisites to group available
/// instructions; this marker does not imply complete revision support.
///
/// See [Arm Architecture Reference Manual, architecture extensions](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest/).
isa ARMv9_3A64 requires [ARMv9_2A64, ARMv8_8A64] {}
/// Armv9.4-A AArch64 revision selector. TIR uses the declared prerequisites to group available
/// instructions; this marker does not imply complete revision support.
///
/// See [Arm Architecture Reference Manual, architecture extensions](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest/).
isa ARMv9_4A64 requires [ARMv9_3A64, ARMv8_9A64] {}
/// Armv9.5-A AArch64 revision selector. TIR uses the declared prerequisites to group available
/// instructions; this marker does not imply complete revision support.
///
/// See [Arm Architecture Reference Manual, architecture extensions](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest/).
isa ARMv9_5A64 requires ARMv9_4A64 {}
/// Armv9.6-A AArch64 revision selector. TIR uses the declared prerequisites to group available
/// instructions; this marker does not imply complete revision support.
///
/// See [Arm Architecture Reference Manual, architecture extensions](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest/).
isa ARMv9_6A64 requires ARMv9_5A64 {}
